<title>USA: Center Point-Urbana CSD, Iowa, won by UMB Bank.</title>
<headline>Center Point-Urbana CSD, Iowa, won by UMB Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>UMB Bank said it won $1.635 million of Center Point-Urbana CSD, Iowa., general oblgation school bond anticipation project notes, with a net interest cost of 4.69 percent.</p>
</text>
